### Cadastrar usuário
POST http://localhost:3000/usuarios/cadastro
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Usuário Teste",
    "email": "teste@biblioteca.com",
    "senha": "senha123"
}

### Tentar cadastrar o mesmo e-mail novamente
POST http://localhost:3000/usuarios/cadastro
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Outro Usuário",
    "email": "teste2@biblioteca.com",
    "senha": "outrasenha123"
}


### Login com credenciais corretas
POST http://localhost:3000/usuarios/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "teste@biblioteca.com",
    "senha": "senha123"
}

### Login com senha incorreta
POST http://localhost:3000/usuarios/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "teste2@biblioteca.com",
    "senha": "senhaerrada"
}

### Login com usuário inexistente
POST http://localhost:3000/usuarios/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "naoexiste2@biblioteca.com",
    "senha": "senha123"
}


### Acessar perfil sem token (esperado: 401)
GET http://localhost:3000/usuarios/perfil

### Acessar perfil com token
### Substitua SEU_TOKEN pelo token recebido no login
GET http://localhost:3000/usuarios/perfil
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MSwicGVyZmlsIjoidXN1YXJpbyIsImlhdCI6MTc5NTcyMDQ0MiwiZXhwIjoxNzk1NzI0MDQyfQ.pS0LZUfjW9g-vTGKueqDa9rWZmq_yMiZ4bPzalYBUms


### Acessar rota administrativa
GET http://localhost:3000/usuarios/admin
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MSwicGVyZmlsIjoidXN1YXJpbyIsImlhdCI6MTc5NTcxNzE2OCwiZXhwIjoxNzk1NzIwNzY4fQ.Q4n04Ozpbt71it1gisTyl5znbNvOLm4y_pA72QjfxKU